WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.270
Keep on holding me

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.270
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:09.150
I listen to your voice in your arms

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:09.150
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:21.960
If I reach out in the light, I can touch

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:21.960
Hikari no naka ni te wo sashinobaseba todoku

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:27.130
The precious arms

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:27.130
Anna ni motomete ita kakegae no nai ude e

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:32.130
I have been searching for so hard

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:32.130
Anna ni motomete ita kakegae no nai ude e

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:39.470
I turn around and the sky of blue

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:39.470
Furimukeba kodoku ni wa

00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:48.940
Smiles down upon my solitude

00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:48.940
Sora ga aoku hohoende kureru

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:56.200
In the darkness, I nearly lose sight of my dreams

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:56.200
Kurayami ni yume wo miushinai sou ni naru

00:00:56.740 --> 00:01:04.120
But if you remain by my side

00:00:56.740 --> 00:01:04.120
Demo anata ga itekureru no nara

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:08.420
Keep on holding me

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:08.420
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:12.090
I listen to your voice in your arms

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:12.090
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:19.260
I want to protect this love for always

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:19.260
Itsudemo kono omoi wo mamoritai no

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:24.600
This love...

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:24.600
Omoi wo

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:35.240
No matter how many times you ask, it's the same.

00:01:35.240 --> 00:01:36.610
We don't know anything...

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:38.570
Like we said before, we don't know.

00:01:38.570 --> 00:01:41.830
Hey, you done yet? I'm starving here.

00:01:41.830 --> 00:01:43.370
I'm sorry.

00:01:44.160 --> 00:01:45.960
Guess we'll just have to drink more.

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:49.960
I'm sorry to bother you during your busy time.

00:01:50.340 --> 00:01:53.960
If you remember anything, please contact us here.

00:01:55.720 --> 00:01:58.010
Yuuki, cheer up.

00:01:58.010 --> 00:02:02.060
Those who come to this island eventually all leave.

00:02:02.060 --> 00:02:03.390
You understand that, right?

00:02:09.730 --> 00:02:13.570
The City Where 
The Angels Disappeared

00:02:12.610 --> 00:02:14.690
I wonder if Doug's mad.

00:02:15.610 --> 00:02:19.280
We couldn't help it, right?
There was no time to talk to him.

00:02:19.820 --> 00:02:23.200
Besides, we couldn't burden him forever.

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:24.450
Yeah.

00:02:24.450 --> 00:02:26.660
Everyone was so nice, weren't they?

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:27.750
Yeah...

00:02:30.630 --> 00:02:32.500
The clouds are below us!

00:02:38.090 --> 00:02:40.720
I can almost touch them! I wish I could!

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:46.220
It's our first time, isn't it?

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:48.100
To travel to a foreign country together...

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:48.850
Yup!

00:02:56.610 --> 00:02:59.530
This world... is so wide, isn't it?

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:11.420
Go away. Today's match is already sold out.

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:13.580
I've got some business at the backdoor.

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:17.260
Entry fee.

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:26.220
Oh yeah? So the GPO was after them?

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:28.140
You sold them passports, right?

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:30.100
I also gave them some other stuff.

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:34.360
I was happy to. Always hated the GPO.

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:38.360
Well, excuse me. I'm a former GPO.

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:41.820
This sounds like an interesting story,

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:44.490
but I don't have time to sit around
and listen to your problems.

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:46.030
I'm in a hurry too.

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:48.620
Give me all the data you sold them.

00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:50.330
Sure, but it'll cost you.

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:53.250
I don't get much business on this island.

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:54.790
Since you hate the GPO,

00:03:54.790 --> 00:03:57.380
I don't need to give you hush money for that, right?

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:18.770
What are you getting all worked up about?

00:04:20.440 --> 00:04:23.110
They're underestimating the GPO.

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:25.620
Using fake passports isn't going to work.

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:27.240
They're just acting like kids.

00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:32.910
To me, you and those girls are one and the same.

00:04:34.870 --> 00:04:38.420
The one the island residents
are talking about is him.

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:40.460
He was my former boss...

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:41.460
What?!

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:44.380
But for some reason, he's an Agent now.

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:46.590
He must have gotten involved by helping Kurau.

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:49.470
How much does he know about Rynax?

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:50.890
I'm not sure.

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:55.980
The two were spotted at the stadium,
but we lost track of them after that.

00:04:57.100 --> 00:04:58.440
The stadium?!

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:06.490
If I ratted out every one of my customers, then I'd be out of business.

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:09.240
There's no data left.

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:12.910
Nice job covering your tracks.

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:17.580
But I guess that's only expected
from a former B-1 Agent?

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:11.050
We're really here!

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:14.810
No one here knows who we are.

00:06:14.810 --> 00:06:17.520
Yeah. How exciting!

00:06:24.030 --> 00:06:26.530
Hey, shall we give ourselves different names?

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:28.030
Names?

00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:33.780
Yeah, a new name that's different from
our real names or the ones on our passports.

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:36.290
Got it! What do you like, Kurau?

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:37.290
Lemon?

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:39.290
Then will it be Chocolate for you?

00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:42.790
Sounds good! Chocolate and hot milk.

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:43.590
Cheese.

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:44.300
Ocean.

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:45.300
Blue.

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:46.130
White!

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:49.180
Sunset, walks, bicycles! Palm of my hand!

00:06:49.180 --> 00:06:50.680
Palm?

00:06:56.060 --> 00:06:59.480
What was that just now? I felt something...

00:06:59.480 --> 00:07:02.060
it's as though someone's calling me...

00:07:02.060 --> 00:07:04.690
I wonder what my name should be?

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:05.900
Let's see now...

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:09.900
It was a very strong feeling,
but it disappeared immediately.

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:12.110
I'm sure it came from that way.

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:16.120
Is something wrong, Kurau?

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:17.370
Huh?

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:19.210
Oh, it's nothing.

00:07:19.210 --> 00:07:22.170
Hey, shall we go for a short drive?

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:22.920
Okay!

00:07:24.630 --> 00:07:25.880
At Los Angeles Airport?

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:28.800
Yes. Our reports say they're in Los Angeles.

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:30.880
The two of them were captured
on the security camera.

00:07:31.220 --> 00:07:33.090
And an hour later,

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:34.100
that man showed up too.

00:08:07.550 --> 00:08:09.840
Looks like you've got nowhere to go.

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:14.510
Sorry, but I'm looking for someone.

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:17.050
Oh, your cute little angel?

00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:21.350
Maybe. She does fly.

00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:34.910
Damn, they've already caught on?

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:50.170
What's the matter?

00:08:50.670 --> 00:08:52.050
Hang on for a sec, okay?

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:13.240
This feeling...

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:17.160
it's closer than before...

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:20.030
Do you feel anything, Christmas?

00:09:21.660 --> 00:09:22.660
I wonder what it is.

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:25.080
It feels so familiar,

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:27.290
but at the same time...

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:30.250
I don't know...

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:33.300
But... I'm kinda scared...

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:34.840
Just a little.

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:38.180
Should I just go to it like it's calling?

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:42.010
But... I want to find out...

00:09:47.230 --> 00:09:49.810
I've thought of a name.

00:09:53.530 --> 00:09:54.900
You're Eine.

00:09:54.900 --> 00:09:55.860
Eine...

00:09:56.490 --> 00:09:58.030
It has a gentle sound to it.

00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:00.240
It's my mother's name.

00:10:00.570 --> 00:10:01.910
Mom's name...

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:06.460
And I'm Kleine. My mother's sister's name.

00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:07.410
Kleine...

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:10.630
Eine, Kleine...

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:18.010
Now, Eine. We'll be in the city soon. You ready to go?

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:20.340
Sure! Kleine!

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:37.440
Ayaka, we've arrived in L.A.

00:10:37.440 --> 00:10:38.860
We'll be landing soon.

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:41.120
I know.

00:10:44.870 --> 00:10:47.040
I can hear it... the voice.

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:51.000
So you understand it, too, don't you?

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:53.670
This is...

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:56.260
A good feeling and a bad feeling.

00:10:56.670 --> 00:10:57.970
I feel both.

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:01.220
Me too.

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:04.260
It's been getting closer since we left the city.

00:11:04.260 --> 00:11:05.100
Yeah.

00:11:05.100 --> 00:11:07.430
But, isn't this...

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:15.570
What is this place?

00:11:16.150 --> 00:11:18.400
It still looks new.

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:22.570
I'm not scared any more. I know for certain now.

00:11:23.120 --> 00:11:26.290
That voice... I can hear it from the other side.

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:28.160
Here...

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:30.960
There are Rynax here.

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:35.290
Rynax... just like us.

00:11:44.970 --> 00:11:46.810
There are Rynax here.

00:11:46.810 --> 00:11:48.970
But why?

00:11:48.970 --> 00:11:51.480
Let me go check inside.

00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:52.560
Kurau!

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:56.820
It's easy. If I use my powers, no one will notice.

00:11:56.820 --> 00:11:59.740
But Kurau... won't you be in pain again?

00:11:59.740 --> 00:12:02.360
Don't worry. I'll just use a little bit.

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:05.320
Wait here, I'll be right back.

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:07.280
Okay.

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:35.520
What on Earth?

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:39.530
Wh-what is this?!

00:12:39.530 --> 00:12:41.530
H-Hey! Come here!

00:12:43.070 --> 00:12:45.070
Huh, what's going on?

00:12:45.070 --> 00:12:46.160
This reaction...

00:12:47.320 --> 00:12:48.950
There's nothing there.

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:53.620
There was a strange reaction...
Something I've never seen before.

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:56.540
Is there any data left of it?

00:12:57.040 --> 00:12:58.130
Y-Yeah...

00:12:58.630 --> 00:13:01.170
Hey! Check the data and system!

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:08.760
Christmas?

00:13:09.680 --> 00:13:10.850
Christmas!

00:13:11.470 --> 00:13:12.470
Kurau!

00:13:16.270 --> 00:13:17.440
Christmas!

00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:19.020
Sorry, Kurau!

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:21.570
I went to go check.

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:24.110
There's an entrance over there...

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:28.030
It said Rynax Energy Plant.

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:30.700
Rynax... Energy?!

00:13:31.490 --> 00:13:32.080
Yeah.

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:36.040
Were there Rynax inside?

00:13:37.420 --> 00:13:39.920
Yes, there were.

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:44.970
They were calling me. In a strong voice.

00:13:46.550 --> 00:13:48.970
That was the Rynax's will...

00:13:49.720 --> 00:13:50.550
No...

00:13:51.850 --> 00:13:53.720
Their desire...

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:57.350
What did the voice say?

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:05.070
They said they want to leave here and
go out into a much wider world.

00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:07.240
A wider world...

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:15.080
Let's go find a place to stay.

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:21.840
We have a report.

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:25.880
Doug's car has been spotted,
but was lost in pursuit.

00:14:26.470 --> 00:14:28.760
Okay. The next time he appears,

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:30.470
even if he is my former boss,

00:14:30.470 --> 00:14:31.890
take him into custody.

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:35.350
Apparently, Kurau and the other girl were not with him.

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:36.600
Expand the search area.

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:37.390
All right.

00:14:39.350 --> 00:14:41.400
It doesn't matter where you run.

00:14:42.310 --> 00:14:44.230
You sound confident.

00:14:46.820 --> 00:14:50.490
I know I can definitely capture Kurau.

00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:52.160
I believe that.

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:54.160
And why is that?

00:14:55.080 --> 00:14:58.580
I have a deep hole in my heart...

00:14:59.460 --> 00:15:02.170
And I have a feeling that I can see her face in there.

00:15:13.720 --> 00:15:15.930
I gotta be careful of my every move now.

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:24.190
Looks like they haven't accessed
the account they bought either.

00:15:33.240 --> 00:15:34.120
Who is it?

00:15:35.030 --> 00:15:36.290
Agent Doug, right?

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:39.620
Yeah, and you are?

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:43.380
Your client, Amami. Kurau's father.

00:15:43.380 --> 00:15:44.290
What?!

00:15:44.840 --> 00:15:45.840
Are you serious?

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:48.510
Sorry, I haven't been able to contact you.

00:15:48.510 --> 00:15:50.880
I'm under GPO surveillance.

00:15:50.880 --> 00:15:52.590
At a research center on the Moon.

00:15:57.720 --> 00:15:59.430
If someone comes, I'll hang up.

00:15:59.430 --> 00:16:02.100
But this call may be bugged too.

00:16:02.100 --> 00:16:03.310
Please be careful.

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:07.150
My girl...

00:16:07.150 --> 00:16:09.570
Please don't tell anyone where my girl is.

00:16:09.940 --> 00:16:12.450
She's facing danger...

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:13.990
I understand.

00:16:13.990 --> 00:16:15.910
I have a ton of questions for you.

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:18.200
Please answer what you can!

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:27.460
Eine, Kleine. Your parents liked Mozart?

00:16:29.300 --> 00:16:31.420
When do I pay for the room?

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:33.430
We'd prefer you pay up front.

00:16:33.430 --> 00:16:37.390
My credit card... is at the bottom of this bag.

00:16:37.390 --> 00:16:39.430
Can I pay on my way out?

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:42.480
In that case, first thing tomorrow morning, please.

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:45.850
First thing? All right.

00:16:50.940 --> 00:16:52.860
I was thinking...

00:16:53.570 --> 00:16:59.120
If I could live traveling around the world with you like this, then that would be okay, too.

00:16:59.120 --> 00:16:59.910
Yeah!

00:17:00.490 --> 00:17:03.750
But there's something I need to do.

00:17:04.920 --> 00:17:07.920
I must tell Dad about you.

00:17:08.340 --> 00:17:09.380
About me?

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:10.500
Yeah...

00:17:11.300 --> 00:17:14.970
That my Pair came out of my body...

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:18.970
And there's something I need to ask him.

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:26.100
Rynax energy. That may be something Dad developed.

00:17:26.600 --> 00:17:29.900
What are people trying to do to Rynax?

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:32.150
I don't know.

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:36.030
I don't know.

00:17:41.200 --> 00:17:43.660
160 km southeast of L.A.

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:45.080
Right here.

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:47.080
Is it that power plant?

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:48.920
Is it just a coincidence?

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:53.960
If Kurau found out about this place,
she may try to obtain some information.

00:17:54.460 --> 00:17:56.510
Send out the search team.

00:17:56.510 --> 00:17:57.340
Yes.

00:18:07.350 --> 00:18:09.230
To a wider world.

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:22.580
They're making their move.

00:18:25.410 --> 00:18:28.670
If the account has been traced,
then the GPO must know about it too.

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:30.080
Will I make it there in time?

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:33.670
Rynax Energy.

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:36.420
There are three sites on Earth, right?

00:18:36.420 --> 00:18:40.140
Yes, although I thought they would be shut down, after the accident on the Moon.

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:46.140
Do we really need to use it
even with all the risks involved?

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:50.900
Can't mankind function on Blue Energy alone?

00:18:51.310 --> 00:18:52.110
Yes.

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:57.320
By acquiring Blue Energy, mankind has been able to expand its world.

00:18:57.320 --> 00:19:01.660
Going beyond countries, we've gone into space
and created large cities on the Moon.

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:04.620
It seemed as though we were satisfied with that.

00:19:04.950 --> 00:19:11.420
But we jumped at the discovery of a new energy source. Rynax Energy...

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:15.170
And then the accident occurred.

00:19:16.090 --> 00:19:18.420
Even knowing the danger, desire still takes over.

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:20.880
Is that how humans are?

00:19:21.510 --> 00:19:24.720
Just as the rich desire to be richer,

00:19:25.220 --> 00:19:29.940
do those with power desire even more power?

00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:34.230
A strong... power...

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:35.980
Two minutes till we arrive.

00:19:37.150 --> 00:19:40.860
All units. Commence operations now.

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:54.250
I'm going to go back to that power plant.

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:56.340
I want to thoroughly investigate it.

00:19:58.510 --> 00:19:59.760
I'll go with you.

00:20:00.670 --> 00:20:01.880
Christmas...

00:20:04.050 --> 00:20:05.800
Okay, let's go together.

00:20:08.970 --> 00:20:12.600
I can understand it, too. How the Rynax feel.

00:20:13.020 --> 00:20:15.610
How they want to go out into the wider world.

00:20:16.270 --> 00:20:18.280
Yeah, I understand that too.

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:20.490
But...

00:20:20.990 --> 00:20:26.530
I don't want the Rynax to come out through you because you'll suffer...

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:30.620
But if there's another way...

00:20:30.620 --> 00:20:34.170
If there's another way, they can come out, right?

00:20:34.170 --> 00:20:35.540
Into this world!

00:20:36.080 --> 00:20:37.420
Christmas...

00:21:22.510 --> 00:21:24.880
I had no idea what had just happened.

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:29.180
